    "expectedRule": "Chapter 6 seals run features in the fixed order consumable -> method -> pet: the first clear of each monster or trap seals the next one, and once all three are sealed further dangerous clears seal nothing. Clearing an index node (index_reward or cracked_core_index_reward) or succeeding at the failure_index event lifts every seal. Display: title 失败封存, status `已封存 n/3`, severity stable at 0, warning at 1, danger at 2-3, meter {n, 3}, targetReached at 0. While consumables are sealed a healing pill is refused with `梦档案馆已封存消耗品，止血丹暂时无法使用。`; while methods are sealed an art is refused with `梦档案馆已封存功法，本场暂时无法运转术法。` (checked before the focus cost). Gates archive_consumable_librarian_spine (failed_file_reward -> paper_librarian) and archive_method_ink_spine (paper_librarian_echo -> ink_sleep_trap) need their feature unsealed and while closed read `道具已封存；先到索引柜或裂核索引解除封存。` and `功法已封存；先到索引柜或裂核索引解除封存。`; the move is then not a legal destination. The pursuer is a separate run system and is disabled after entry so it cannot ambush the walk. All expected values are frozen here, never read from candidate code."
  },
